DESCRIPTION:Sharief Johnson is a New Jersey-born comedian\, actor\, and wri
 ter whose energetic storytelling and sharp crowd work have made him a risin
 g name in stand-up comedy. A veteran performer of more than a decade\, Shar
 ief has appeared on major comedy stages and festivals\, including Netflix I
 s a Joke Festival\, Laughing Skull Comedy Festival\, and the Big Pine Comed
 y Festival\, where he earned Best of the Fest honors.As an actor\, Sharief 
 is known for his recurring role as Damon on the hit series "Power Book III:
  Raising Kanan\," which has introduced him to audiences around the world. H
 e has also appeared in film and television while continuing to build his re
 putation as a dynamic live performer.Sharief has released comedy through Si
 riusXM and is known for his relatable\, high-energy approach to comedy. Fol
 lowing his first album\, "I Wish That Was a Joke\," Sharief returns to the 
 stage to record his second comedy album as part of the New York Comedy Fest
 ival.Presented by the New York Comedy Festival.\nMore info: https://comedya
 tlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/sharief-johnson-i-wish-that-was-a-joke-too-albu
 m-recording-presented-by-the-new-york-comedy-festival/
